{{:Header/Pets}}
==Setup==
In Trekking pets obtained from breeding in [[Hatchery]] are used to fight through zones of enemies to collect vessels. Vessels are used in [[Research]] to upgrade the lab mainframe and vats.

Your team consists of two rows. On the bottom row are your fighters. Pets placed here can use normal attacks and attack moves. On the top row are your supports. These pets cannot attack but they do contribute their [[Hatchery#Genes|genes]] and health to the team.

The power of pet attacks is based on its pet level. The health of your team is based on the sum of every pet on your team.

Your team starts out with two fighter pet spots. More fighter and support pet spots are unlocked as your trekking level increases.
