Support spots can be upgraded to Arcane Carpets in the [[Gem_Shop#Pets|Gem Shop]]. These double the effect of pet genetics and make genetics count twice towards combos for pets placed on the carpet.
The most optimal setups can be found in [[Builds#Trekking_Builds|Builds.]]

